WEBVTT

00:40:27.307 --> 00:40:30.704
being in space broadened Scott's idea
of who his neighbors were.

00:40:31.960 --> 00:40:33.356
SK: When we're in space,

00:40:33.380 --> 00:40:35.000
and you look down at planet Earth,

00:40:35.024 --> 00:40:38.266
the planet is incredibly beautiful.

00:40:38.290 --> 00:40:40.756
During the daytime,
you don't see political borders,

00:40:40.780 --> 00:40:46.846
and it makes it look like humanity
is all part of one big team,

00:40:46.870 --> 00:40:49.066
and when you're part of a team,

00:40:49.090 --> 00:40:51.369
you need to work together
to solve our problems.

00:40:51.393 --> 00:40:53.366
And I think this virus has shown us

00:40:53.390 --> 00:40:56.596
that we're really, for better or worse,

00:40:56.620 --> 00:40:59.913
more interconnected
than I really realized.